lopedia/thumbs/konstantin-konik.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Konstantin Konik</span><span class="tp">1873–1936</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/makarios-iii"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/makarios-iii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Makarios III</span><span class="tp">1913–1977</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/aleksandr-solzhenitsyn"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/aleksandr-solzhenitsyn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Aleksandr Solzhenitsyn</span><span class="tp">1918–2008</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
